    {
      "source": "Resolve a given plain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value into the store native keyId format, considering potential\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>expressions</code></a>. <br/>\nThe potential keyId is probed against an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html#fromString(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID value</code></a> or decoded from the\nbase64 representation prior to conversion into its <code>Binary</code> format.",
      "translation": "将给定的普通<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>值解析为存储原生 keyId 格式，同时考虑潜在的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>expressions</code></a>。<br/>\n在转换为<code>Binary</code>格式之前，会先探测潜在的 keyId 是否为一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html#fromString(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID value</code></a>，或者从 base64 表示中解码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve a given plain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value into the store native keyId format, considering potential\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>expressions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的普通 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>String</code></a> 值解析为存储原生 keyId 格式，同时考虑潜在的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>expressions</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Internal utility class for dealing with encryption related matters.",
      "translation": "用于处理加密相关事务的内部工具类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>evaluationContext</code> - a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> used to provide the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> in case an\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>Expression</code></a> is <a href=\"../spel/ExpressionUtils.html#detectExpression(java.lang.String)\"><code>detected</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>evaluationContext</code> - 一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Supplier</code></a>，用于在检测到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>Expression</code></a> 时提供 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if one of the required arguments is null.",
